beforeYouStart.list.bullet1.linkText = reasonable excuse (opens in new tab)
beforeYouStart.list.bullet2 = when the reasonable excuse ended
beforeYouStart.list.bullet3 = what happened in your own words
beforeYouStart.warning = If HMRC decide we need extra information or evidence after reviewing your appeal, we will contact you.
